# Project: Airbnb Listing Clone (.cursorrules)

## Architecture & Code Style Guidelines
- **Framework**: React 18+ with Vite and Tailwind CSS.
- **Strict Visual Parity**: Emulate Airbnb's design system ("DLS"):
  - Typography: Circular/San-serif font stack with precise tracking and line heights.
  - Colors: Brand Coral `#FF385C`, Dark Accent `#D70466`, Charcoal text `#222222`, Muted `#717171`, Borders `#DDDDDD`.
  - Shadows: `shadow-airbnb` (`0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)`) and `shadow-airbnb-hover` (`0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.18)`).
- **Behavioral & Overlay Requirements**:
  1. Listing Page: 5-hero photo collage, responsive right-side sticky booking card, guest favourite laurel banner.
  2. Photo Tour: Full-screen overlay, category thumbnail tab bar with smooth scroll, room tags, photo grids.
  3. Lightbox: Full-screen image viewer, keyboard left/right arrow navigation, Escape to dismiss, 9-dot grid icon to return to photo tour, X to close.
- **Accessibility & UX**:
  - Full keyboard trap and focus restoration on modals.
  - Images must include `referrerPolicy="no-referrer"` to prevent CDN hotlink throttling.
  - All interactive icons must have `aria-label` tags.
